<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar officials to discuss 97/98 export tender.</title>
<headline>EU sugar officials to discuss 97/98 export tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar officials will on Wednesday discuss arrangements for launching the 1997/98 (July/June) export tender, European Commission officials said.</p>
<p>The last tender for the current season will be held on July 30 and the first tender of the new season on August 6.</p>
<p>-Brussels bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
